; Run the QEMU guest agent's domain permissive while the rest of the system
; enforces. Commands that Proxmox's guest-exec and set-password RPCs (and the
; cf verify smoke test) start inherit virt_qemu_ga_t, where policy denies even
; `systemctl is-system-running`. See finalize.sh.
(typepermissive virt_qemu_ga_t)
